  "description": "Young-ha, who has long dreamed of a spring-like love, is about to marry Seo-ju, whom she has been secretly in love with. She eagerly awaits her first night with Seo-ju, who has become her husband, but Seo-ju must leave for the north to defend her country. It is said that it will be at least five years before Seo-ju returns after the war. Unable to wait for Seo-ju indefinitely, Young-ha sets out for the north to meet her husband herself…\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/finding_my_husband)",
